    <task id="Id_06713262-ea9b-47bd-b475-2016f60641f4" name="5.5.2 Mobilizar a tecnologia da informação">
      <documentation>&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;Este item trata da mobiliza&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o de tecnologia, tanto de hardware quanto de software. Ela abrange o ambiente comum de dados (CDE) e qualquer outra tecnologia que sustente a gera&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o e a troca de informa&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es especificamente. A atividade de mobiliza&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o deve resultar na instala&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o, configura&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o e teste adequado da tecnologia para apoiar a gera&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o e a troca de informa&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es entre todos os membros da equipe do projeto. Isso &amp;eacute; para garantir que as informa&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es possam ser trocadas com confian&amp;ccedil;a entre os membros da equipe de entrega e entre as partes contratada e contratante&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;1. Adquirir, implementar, configurar e testar software, hardware e infraestrutura de TI&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;2. Configurar e testar o ambiente comum de dados (CDE) do projeto&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;3. Teste as trocas de informa&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es entre as equipes de tarefas&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;4. TEste a entrega de infomra&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o com a contratante.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</documentation>
      <extensionElements>
        <bizagi:BizagiExtensions xmlns:bizagi="http://www.bizagi.com/bpmn20">
          <bizagi:BizagiProperties>
            <bizagi:BizagiProperty name="bgColor" value="#E5B9B7" />
            <bizagi:BizagiProperty name="borderColor" value="#956967" />
            <bizagi:BizagiProperty name="textColor" value="#000000" />
            <bizagi:BizagiProperty name="textBackgroundColor" value="Transparent" />
            <bizagi:BizagiProperty name="textDirection" value="" />
          </bizagi:BizagiProperties>
        </bizagi:BizagiExtensions>
      </extensionElements>
