    <task id="Id_8dc730d0-76f1-46a5-8cba-0a7a398cd3e2" name="5.5.3 Testar métodos e procedimentos">
      <documentation>&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;A cl&amp;aacute;usula 5.5.3 se concentra em garantir que os m&amp;eacute;todos e procedimentos para a produ&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o e troca de informa&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es sejam compreendidos por todos os membros da equipe de entrega e possam ser implementados desde o in&amp;iacute;cio das atividades de gera&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o de informa&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es. Isso envolver&amp;aacute; o teste dos m&amp;eacute;todos e procedimentos de produ&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o de informa&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es do projeto.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;1. Testar e documentar m&amp;eacute;todos e procedimentos de produ&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o da informa&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o do projeto;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;2. Refinar e verificar se a estrutura anal&amp;iacute;tica proposta do cont&amp;ecirc;iner &amp;eacute; vi&amp;aacute;vel;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;3. Desenvolver recursos compartilhados para serem usados pe&amp;ccedil;a equipe de tarefa; e&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;4. Comunicar os m&amp;eacute;todos e os procedimentos de produ&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o da informa&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o do projeto para todas as equipes de tarefas.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</documentation>
      <extensionElements>
        <bizagi:BizagiExtensions xmlns:bizagi="http://www.bizagi.com/bpmn20">
          <bizagi:BizagiProperties>
            <bizagi:BizagiProperty name="bgColor" value="#E5B9B7" />
            <bizagi:BizagiProperty name="borderColor" value="#956967" />
            <bizagi:BizagiProperty name="textColor" value="#000000" />
            <bizagi:BizagiProperty name="textBackgroundColor" value="Transparent" />
            <bizagi:BizagiProperty name="textDirection" value="" />
          </bizagi:BizagiProperties>
        </bizagi:BizagiExtensions>
      </extensionElements>
